---
version: "0.2.0"
features:
- name: code
  dtype: string
- name: language
  dtype: string
- name: tokens
  dtype: int
- name: recorded
  dtype: date(dd.MM.yyyy)
- name: wav
  dtype: audio
- name: status
  dtype: string
meta:
  description: Inspired by HuggingFace dataset cards; date format via :date(fmt):.
---
code|language|tokens :int:|recorded :date(dd.MM.yyyy):|wav :audio:|status
